The scripts here operate on a Game Porting Toolkit redist that YOU download
from Apple yourself, using your own Apple Developer account, and mount
locally. Nothing is fetched, bundled, vendored, or mirrored by this project.
The scripts read from the volume you mount and write into a wrapper you
already own.

